<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">Habakkuk</book>
  <para style="h">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="mt">Habakkuk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Profet Habakkuk hnenah Bawipa ih thu a ra thlengmi cu hiti in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , bomnak dil in ka aunak hi ziangtikah so i theihsak ding? Tisiatnak sungin in runsuak hlanah hin voi ziangzatso ka lo kawh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangah so hi bangtuk harsatnak cu i tonter? Ziangtin so hitluk thil ṭha lo an tuahmi hi na zoh thei cuahco lai? Siatsuahnak le tisualnak hlir ka kiangkap ah an khat ih thawi awknak le tawh awknak lawnglawng khuazakip ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Daan timi hi hmual a nei lo ih ṭhathnemnak khal a nei lo. Thildik timi cu tuahsuak a si dah lo. Mi ṭha lo pawl in mi ṭha pawl ih lu parah an kai; cuticun thufel timi cu anmah ih duhduh in an her thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in a minung pawl ih hnenah, “Nan kiangkap ih miphun pawl hi zoh ṭha uh; nan hmuh tikah cun nan mang a bangzet ding. Thil pakhat ka tuah ding ih nan theih tikah nan zum lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi puar le mi tokhrok pawl Babilon mi pawl kha thuneitu ah ka tuah ding. Anmah cu ram dang neh dingin leilung pumpi ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawzakip ah thinphannak le tuksumnak hlir an khahter. An hngal tukah anmah ih thu lawng daan ah an neih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“An rang pawl cu tlavang hnakin an zamrang sawn; rilrawng cinghnia cang hnakin ṭih an nung sawn. An rangralkap pawl cu an rang to in ram hlapi ihsin an ra. An rang cu leilung an huat phahphah. Khaupi in an sadehmi an zon bangin ral cu an zon a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“An ralkap pawl in ram an nor vivo; a kham theitu zohman an um lo. An thlen ding thawmvang an theih cun zozo khal ṭihnak in an khat. Ral an kaihmi cu vunnel zat in an tam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang pawl an nautat ih bawi upa pawl an hnihsan. Ziangvek ralhruang hman in a kham thei lo. A leng ihsin lei an dawl ih an lak thei thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule thli bangin an hrang ih an hlota. An cahnak kha khawzing tlukah an ruat!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , a hramthok ihsin nang cu Pathian na si. Nang cu ka Pathian na si, a thianghlimmi le kumkhua in a hmunmi na si. Maw Bawipa , ka Pathian le ka Lungpi, nangmah in Babilon mi pawl cu na hril zo ih kanmah hrem theitu tiangin na cakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ziangtinso hitluk mi ṭha lo le mi huaisen pawl hi na zawi thei? Thil ṭha lo zoh-nakah na mit cu an thianghlim tuk ih sualnak a tuahtu pawl cu na hmu thei ṭheu lo a si. Ziangah so anmah hnakih miding pawl an siatsuah rero naón daiziar ih na um san men?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ziangtin so minung cu uktu le hotu nei lo nga vek le cucik kharbok vek tlukah na tuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Babilon mi pawl in midang cu nga vekin sio in an sio. Sur in an awk, an dirhsuak ih an kaihmi ruangah lungawi in an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An sur in thil ṭha bik an ngah thei ruangah an sur hnenah raithawinak an pek ih an biak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumkhua in maw an ralnam hmang tahratin miphun pawl cu zaangfahnak nei loin an siatsuah rero ko ding?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ralvennak donhleisang ah ka hung kai ding ih Bawipa in ka ṭong dingmi ziangvek i sim ding tile ka phunzainak kha ziangtin i sawn ding, ti ka hngak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cun hiti in i run sim, “Na hnen ih ka langter mi cu voikhat zohnak in siar thei dingah lungpher parah fiangtein ngan aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngan fel aw, ziangahtile a kimnak tikcu a si hrih lo. Asinain cuih tikcu cu zamrang in a ra thleng ding ih ka lo hmuhmi cu a kim ngaingai ding. A kimnak tikcu a tlai vek a bang ding naón thinsau in hngak aw; a kim tengteng ding ih a tikcu cu a tlai nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih thu cu: ‘Mi ṭha lo pawl cu an luat lo ding; sikhalsehla mi ding pawl cu Pathian rintlak an si ruangah an nung ding,’ tihi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lennak cu mibum a hmang. Mi duhham pawl cu an puarthau ih daiteón an um thei lo: thihnak vekin khawh ti an nei dah lo. Mithi khua Sheol bangtuk an si: a tawk zo an ti dah lo. Curuangah a si miphun pakhat hnu pakhat anmah ih hrang lawnglawng ah an neh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Neh mi pawl in nehtu pawl cu an roh hai ding ih an nautatnak an langter ding. “Nan ta a si lomi nan lak; asinain nan cem ve ding. Lei a lo baktu pawl leiba pe dingah hneekcih tahrat in nan lian deuh deuh; ziangtik tiangso cutin nan tlanleen vivo hrih ding?” an ti hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain nan theih man hlanah, nannih mi nehtu cu leiba neitu ah nan cang ve ding ih midang in paisa ṭhang pe dingah an lo hnekcih ve ding. Ral pawl an ra ding ih nan ṭih ruangah khur thlohthlo in an lo tuah ding. An lo ram ciamco ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Miphun tampi cu nangmah in na ram. Asinain a nungsun pawl in, mi tampi na thah zo ruangah le leilung pumpi khawpi pawl le an minung pawl na tisiat ṭheh ruangah an lo ram ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na cem a si! Midang siatsuah tahrat in na innsang cu na lianter; na umnak inn cu siatsuahnak le ṭihphannak ihsin himseh tiah na ngaihtuah ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla na ngaihtuahnak cu a lak an si, na innsang ningzahnak a thlentu sawn an si. Miphun tampi na siatsuahnak in nangmah parah siatsuahnak na thlenter zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Phar ih dawlmi lungto hman cu nangmah dodal in a au ding ih innbo in aw-khawk in a run sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na cem a si! Khawpi cu mi siatsuahnak thawn na din ih mi thahnak thawn na sak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na nehmi miphun pawl in an tha cem ko in thil ṭhahnem lo hna an ṭuan ih an sak ciami pawl cu meisa in a kang ṭheh. Cumi cu Cungnungbik Bawipa ih thil tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain tifinriat cu tidai in a khah vekin leilung cu Bawipa ih sunlawinak theihnak in a khat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na cem a si! Na thinheng ah na innhnen pawl ningzak in na tuah ih an mual na photer; zu ri bangin na tlukter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah nang khal upatnak cotu si loin ningzahnak in na khat ding. Nangmah rori zu na in ding ih na sawn in na ril ding a si. Bawipa in nangmah hremnak khuathai a lo inter ding ih upat hminṭhatnak na neihmi cu mualphonak ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lebanon tupi ih thing na hau ṭheh; atu ahcun nangmah hau na si ding. A ramsa pawl na that hai; atu ahcun ramsa pawl ṭihnak thawn na khat ding. Leilung pumpi minung le an khawpi pawl na siatsuah ruangah le milai tampi na thah ruangah hi bangtuk in na parah a thleng ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Milem in ziangso ṭhathnemnak a neih? Milai ih tuahcopmi thil pakhat men a si ih thuphan dah ti lo a lo sim theimi zianghman a um lo. Milem tuahtu in a tuahmi cu a rinsan tikah ziangso a hrangah a ṭhahnem? ṭong hman a ṭong thei lomi khawzing cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na cem riai a si! Thingtan hnenah cun, “Ṭhang aw,” na ti. Lungtlep khat hnenah, “Tho aw,” na ti. Milem in na hnenah langter theimi ziangtal a nei maw? Sui le ngun in khuutmi a si ding naón a sungah nunnak a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa cu a Biakinn thianghlim sungah a um. A hmaiah leilungtlun mi hmuahhmuah cu daitein umseh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Profet Habakkuk thlacamnak cu hiti in a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maw Bawipa , na thil tuahmi ka thei zo, Mangbangza ngaingai an si. Na thil tuahmi pawl cu a thar in Kan san ahhin tuah sal hram aw. Na thin a heng lai hmanah Kan parah zaangfahnak nei hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian cu Edom ihsin a ra sal. Pathian thianghlim cu Paran tlang ihsin a ra. A sunlawinak in van a khuh, A thangṭhatnak cu leilung ah a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A rat tikah cun nimthlakau vekin a tleu, A kut ihsin tleunak a suak zukzo; Cutawkah a cahnak cu thuh in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Natnak a hmai ah a thlah ih, Thihnak cu a dungih thlun dingin thu a pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah a cawlh tikah leilung a hnin durdo; A mit zoh meen ah miphun kip an ṭhia thlohthlo. Kumkhua hmun tlangsaangpi pawl cu an kuai ṭheh, Sanmureng in a rak ummi tlang cu an pil ṭheh. Khuahlan lai ihsin a rak zawh ṭheumi tlang pawl cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kushan mi pawl thlaṭem in an um ka hmu; Midian mi pawl khal an khur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa , tiva in na thin an lo tok a si maw? Tifinriat in na ai an lo thawhter a si maw? Nang cu khawdur parah na to, Thlipi cu na rangleng a si; Na minung pawl hnen ih nehnak na pek tikah cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na li cu na nawp, Na conkiang sai dingah na bih. Na nimthlakau in leilung cu a phelkuai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlangsangpi pawl in an lo hmuh tikah an ṭhia thlohthlo. Van ihsin tidai an run thlet. Leilung hnuai tidai an awn ciamco, Tilet cu saangzet in an tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na conkiang eeng zohzo ih a suah tikah le, Na feipi tleu zurzo ih a zam tikah cun, Ni le thlapi cu an umnak hmun ah an ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na thinheng in leilung cu na pal, Na thin ai-thok in miphun pawl na rial a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain na minung pawl hum dingah na suak, Hriak na culhmi hum dingah cun. Miṭhalo pawl ih hotu cu na sah thlak ih, A dungthlun pawl cu na siatsuah ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na conkiang in a ralkap hotu bawi a ngah, Kanmah ṭhekdarh dingah thlipi bangih a rat tikah cun! Thupteih mi farah a hremtu vekin, Kanmah hnihsan phah ih a rat tikah cun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na rang pawl thawn tifinriat na pal tikah cun, A nasa zetmi tipi cu a phuul ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cumi pawl ka theih tikah ka khur, Ka hmur cu ṭihnak in a ṭhia. Ka ruangpi a caang thei nawn lo, Ka ke an sawn, in din lo. Kanmah in dotu pawl Pathian in a hrem tikcu caan, Thinsau in ka hngak ding, a ra thleng dingmi caan cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theipi in rah an neih lo ih Sabit hri ih sabit a rah lo hmanah, Olif kung ih olif rah an siat ṭheh ih, Lo in rawl a suah lo hmanah, Tuu pawl an thih fai ṭheh ih, Caw inn tla an lawng ṭheh hmanah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungawi in ka thin a nuam thotho ding; Ziangahtile Bawipa Pathian cu i runtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in thazaang i pe; Zukneng bangin ka ke a fekter, Tlangsang parah himte in i ret.
  </para>
</usx>
